<title>UK: UBS sets call warrants on itself.</title>
<headline>UBS sets call warrants on itself.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland says it has issued 20 million American-style call warrants, on Union Bank of Switzerland.</p>
<p>50 warrants control one share.</p>
<p> STRIKE PRICE    1,400.00 CHF	    PREMIUM	12.32 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     1.64 CHF		  GEARING	16.2 TIMES</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 12.MAR.97-20.MAR.98   PAYDATE	12.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   SWX			 MIN EXER LOT 100</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  1,319.00 CHF</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
